### Test Server (should return 200)
GET http://localhost:3000

### ===== AUTHENTICATION =====

### Register User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login User (COPY token from response body)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ===== PASTE TOKEN BELOW =====
### After you run "Login User" above, copy the token value and paste it below
### Example: @token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2OWNmMTRmNTlhNWQyNWMzNmYwZDBjMWMiLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3RAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzY5MTMyMzksImV4cCI6MTc3NjkxNjgzOX0.xlPgpuJ-3bqam27jfgVzpfTNhgpgyzK_JHft4Ld6IrQ
### ===== NOTE CRUD TESTS =====

### Create Note
POST http://localhost:3000/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "My Second Note",
  "content": "<h1>Hello World</h1>"
}

### Get All Notes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Single Note
GET http://localhost:3000/api/notes/69cf159a9a5d25c36f0d0c1f
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Note
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/notes/69cf159a9a5d25c36f0d0c1f
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "content": "<p>Updated</p>"
}

### Delete Note
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/notes/REPLACE_WITH_NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== FOLDER CRUD TESTS =====

### Create Folder
POST http://localhost:3000/api/folders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Work Notes"
}

### Get All Folders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rename Folder (replace REPLACE_WITH_FOLDER_ID with _id from create response)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/folders/69d04b8b282d2983f8aa3075
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Personal Notes"
}

### Delete Folder
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/folders/REPLACE_WITH_FOLDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== TODO CRUD TESTS =====

### Create Todo (without note)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "Buy groceries"
}

### Create Todo (with note - replace noteId with actual note ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "second todo"
}

### Get All Todos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Todo (mark as completed)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/todos/69e049ef97070af53706a562
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "completed": true
}

### Update Todo (edit content)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/todos/69e049ef97070af53706a562
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "Updated todo content"
}

### Delete Todo
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/todos/69e049ef97070af53706a562
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== BRAIN DUMP =====

### Save Today's Brain Dump
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/braindump
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "Need to finish the AI review feature. Also thinking about refactoring the todo list. Keep getting distracted by emails."
}

### Get Today's Brain Dump
GET http://localhost:3000/api/braindump
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== AI DAILY REVIEW =====

### Get Today's Daily Review (AI-generated)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/review/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
